  era: "c. 544\u2013321 BCE \xB7 Section 5 \xB7 Mahajanapadas \xB7 c. 600 \u2013 321 BCE"
  title: Rise of Magadha
  text: 'Magadha, in Bihar, became the most powerful state thanks to fertile land, iron ore, rivers for transport, elephants and able rulers: Bimbisara and Ajatashatru of the Haryanka dynasty, then the Shishunagas and the Nandas. Pataliputra became its capital.'
